-- Local demo only. Do not reuse these passwords anywhere else.
--   admin@fakebank.local            LocalAdmin#2026     role admin
--   merchant.north@fakebank.local   LocalNorth#2026     role user
--   merchant.east@fakebank.local    LocalEast#2026      role user
--
-- Hash algorithm is bcrypt ($2a$), generated by pgcrypto. The login code must
-- verify bcrypt. Re-running this file does not duplicate rows.
--
-- Golden transactions are the 10 rows a human can recompute by hand.
-- The ~5,000-row set comes from scripts/generate_data.py, which must skip
-- existing txn_ref values and must use the same formula as transaction_tb.

BEGIN;

